ng but  easy that's because makikula managed to  use the curse affecting loro  to somehow turn her into a devil a devil  who now seems to be under megicula's  complete control  in fact devil loro now possesses a new  type of magic  demon water magic and this new magic  certainly does not have any issues with  offensive attacks  in fact this demon water magic looks  absolutely  deadly as soon as the magic activates a  massive  water hydra with many heads appears  around loropichika  and the hydra advances on gaia noel can  tell right away that this is extremely  bad  and she tries to stop megikula before  she can do any more damage to loro  but megikula possesses a spell called  curse warding magic  decaying whirl which is able to negate  noelle's magic and stop her attack  in its tracks megikula is clearly way  stronger than vanica was  and she says that the only person who's  been able to counter her curses thus far  has been the queen of briars  charlotte this is a clear indication  that charlotte is about to become  relevant in the fight once again  and since i like charlotte as a  character i'm glad that she has unique  powers that will likely come in handy  during this  spade kingdom showdown this is not the  last we've seen of charlotte  and that's actually awesome because i  want to see her stay on the front lines  and eventually have an epic reunion with  yami  oh and it's around this time that real  remembers that hey  maybe i should stop standing around and  actually do something during this fight  taking inspiration from noel's norse  mythology-based magic  real creates a massive picture magic  spell called  twilight of valhalla but as cool as this  spell  is and as amazing as it's definitely  going to look in the anime  unfortunately mcgill's cursed warding  magic is able to counter it  and at the same time that this main  battle against magikala is happening  gaia is using his true lightning magic  to make his way around that demon hydra  in a desperate